Not every car off the lot runs like it should. If your new or used vehicle keeps breaking down - even after multiple repairs - you may have a lemon on your hands. Fortunately, California protects consumers through the Song-Beverly Consumer Warranty Act, better known as the California Lemon Law. If you’re in Riverside County, a Moreno Valley Lemon Law Lawyer helps you understand your rights and fight for the refund or replacement you deserve.

## The qualifications of California Lemon Law include

- You’ve taken your car in for the same issue multiple times, but it keeps coming back.

- Your vehicle has spent 30 or more total days in the shop for repairs under warranty.

- The car has a problem that affects how safe, reliable, or functional it is - and it hasn’t been fixed.

