## Moreno Valley Lemon Law and Used Vehicles

California extends lemon law rights to used vehicles, but time limits are shorter. Here’s how it works:

## Dealership Warranty

Most used cars sold by dealerships include a limited warranty - often covering the first 30 days or 1,000 miles. If your vehicle shows serious defects during this period, it may qualify under CA Lemon Law.

## Your Rights

If your used car meets the legal criteria, the dealership is required to repair the issue or offer a refund and they must cover your legal fees.

## Did You Buy the Vehicle “As Is”?

Buying a car “as is” limits your lemon law options unless the dealer didn’t clearly display the disclaimer. If that’s the case, a Lemon Law Attorney can help you explore your options.

## Vehicles that Moreno Valley Lemon Law Applies To

Cars, Vans, SUVs, Trucks, Motor Home or Recreational Vehicle, Scooters, Motorcycles

